 *
 * Primary anchors: Northwestern Medill Local News Initiative ???
 * State of Local News 2024 & 2025; UNC Hussman Expanding News Desert
 * research (2004???2020 vintage); Medill press summaries.
 *
 * Definitions: a ???news desert??? county has zero locally based outlets
 * producing original local reporting (newspapers, digital, ethnic media,
 * public broadcasters as counted by Medill). ???One-source??? counties retain
